 "answer_verbatim": "A good starting point is **GRC General Construction**. It handles kitchen and bathroom renovations, flooring, and custom carpentry, and its BBB profile lists it as accredited with an A+ rating. Call **(417) 499-7424** to ask whether it takes on your type of project and request a written estimate.\n\nFor a broader remodel, **American Construction, Inc.** says it has served Joplin since 1993 and offers remodeling; its number is **(417) 781-6811**. For roofing, siding, or storm-related repairs, **Roof Master’s Remodeling** is another local option, at **(417) 726-5226**.\n\nThese are leads, not guarantees. Before hiring, get at least three written bids, ask for recent references and proof of insurance, and confirm who will handle permits and any subcontracted work. BBB ratings are one signal, not a substitute for checking project-specific references.",
